Three-Class Parkinson’s disease screening from smartwatch motion signals: A comparison of physics-informed handcrafted features and deep embeddings with patient-level validation
Imad Majed Zeebaree a b
, 
Firas Mahmood Mustafa AlFaqi c
Show more
